        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF151 Element.requestFullScreen() option.keyboardLock docs]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43884</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43884"/>
        <updated>2026-04-21T08:13:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF151 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">options.keyboardlock</code> property to be passed in the options object to <code class="notranslate">Element.requestFullScreen()</code> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2032302" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2032302</a>.<br>
This allows use cases such as games to use the Esc key (say) without exiting full screen mode.</p>
<p dir="auto">The PR updates the docs for <code class="notranslate">Element.requestFullScreen()</code> with the new option.</p>
<p dir="auto">It also fixes up layout issues and restructures the document to current standards - adding things like permissions policy integration and so on.</p>
<p dir="auto">Draft until:</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> Confirmed what is enabled/not enabled/standard.</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Check examples - work but not in playground</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> Add new example for the new option.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4295598482" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43868" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43868/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43868">#43868</a></p>]]></content>
